Subject: [PATCH 7/7] test(zoo): cover public audio speak early-break and
 pending-queue recovery

Drive the real createLfm3Audio wiring with faked IO boundaries: a
stream-only consumer takes one chunk and breaks, cancellation rejects the
result with no unhandled rejection, and the next speak succeeds. The
fused-queue recovery successor is genuinely pending so both legs exercise
queue rejection and requeue.
